From ad13e319317216224a52e7f584ef28cbd9d53b29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 01:09:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Audit fix e (work in progress): rule texts, FIBA ranking,
 evidence, feedback, incentives

Saved when the run was stopped, before this group's tests, reconcile and
review. Per-season rule texts for season awards and draft orders, FIBA
page sides and final ranking, season evidence appearance rule for seasons
not yet written, the 2006-07 trajectory feedback matcher, and Wade's
points-per-game incentive evaluation with dated corrections for 2004-05
and 2005-06. The birth-date annotations (BIRTH-01) were not started, and
no test file was written yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ExmaEeFA7X8K2pJG6n4PLH
